WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.648
In under two minutes, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest.

00:00:04.648 --> 00:00:05.625
We start on the map.

00:00:06.526 --> 00:00:09.916
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:15.042
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:17.550
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.906
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:23.099
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:23.783
Tap Allow.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.186
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:32.310
See the three dots?

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:32.816
Tap them.

00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:37.593
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:39.391 --> 00:00:41.028
Under Live now, tap Vote.

00:00:41.028 --> 00:00:43.924
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:00:43.924 --> 00:00:46.253
That keeps it to one vote per person.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.845
Want to see the homes first?

00:00:49.845 --> 00:00:53.654
Visit the homes puts them in a few driving routes, in your maps app.

00:00:55.179 --> 00:00:57.071
Every home is in every category.

00:00:57.071 --> 00:00:59.765
In Best Traditional, tap Vote on your favorite.

00:01:01.823 --> 00:01:03.928
The next category opens by itself.

00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:06.513
Tap Vote on your favorite creative display.

00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:10.086
Last, Best Animated.

00:01:10.086 --> 00:01:11.458
Tap your favorite.

00:01:13.822 --> 00:01:14.831
Thanks for voting!

00:01:14.831 --> 00:01:17.275
You can change your vote until voting closes.

00:01:17.275 --> 00:01:19.824
Tap Share this contest to send it to a neighbor.

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:23.713
Next up: Judge a contest.
